  Title:
    m_Untranslated: Unity Learn
  Text:
    m_Untranslated: "<b><a href=\"https://learn.unity.com/pathway/unity-essentials?utm_source=nuo-1.0.0&utm_medium=iet\">Unity
      Essentials pathway</a></b>: This beginner learning pathway includes everything
      you need to create confidently with Unity.\n\n<b><a href=\"https://learn.unity.com/project/roll-a-ball?utm_source=nuo-1.0.0&utm_medium=iet\">3D
      Beginner: Roll-a-Ball Game</a></b>: Want to jump straight into game creation?
      Follow this tutorial to make a simple game from scratch.\n\n<b><a href=\"https://learn.unity.com/course/create-with-code?utm_source=nuo-1.0.0&utm_medium=iet\">Create
      with Code</a></b>: In this more comprehensive coding course, you'll learn to
      program your own games in C#. \n\n<b><a href=\"https://learn.unity.com?utm_source=gsu-1.0.0&utm_medium=iet\">Unity
      Learn</a></b>: Explore more tutorials, pathways, and courses that cover 3D,
      2D, art, programming, and much more! "
  m_CriteriaCompletion: 0
  m_Criteria:
    m_Items: []
